chat.block_writing.line.01=You should not have come here.
chat.block_writing.line.02=This is not a place of honor. No great deed is commemorated here.
chat.block_writing.line.03=Nothing of value is here.
chat.block_writing.line.04=What is here is dangerous and repulsive.
chat.block_writing.line.05=We considered ourselves a powerful culture. We harnessed the hidden fire, and used it for our own purposes.
chat.block_writing.line.06=Then we saw the fire could burn within living things, unnoticed until it destroyed them.
chat.block_writing.line.07=And we were afraid.
chat.block_writing.line.08=We built great tombs to hold the fire for one hundred thousand years, after which it would no longer kill.
chat.block_writing.line.09=If this place is opened, the fire will not be isolated from the world, and we will have failed to protect you.
chat.block_writing.line.10=Leave this place and never come back.
